==Battleground==
*8 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*8 [[Croco]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*8 [[Croco]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gary Gory]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
To deal with the high-ish amount of Crocos, use fast [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|area attackers]] to quickly take them down. After the Gory Junior spawns, you should focus on the Squire Rels first, then deal with the Gory Junior. He has enough power to take out some of your units, so you'll need to keep up a stream of meatshields and use backliners to chip it down and take it out. After it dies, the stage should be practically over.

